            "review_title": "Review at Kappou Nishiyama",
            "review_text": "donghh24\nHcmc48 contributions\n0\nWarm and comfy omakase with good food\nNov 2024 • Friends\nI've been to many Omakase restaurants before heading to Kappou Nishiyama. As its name- this is a traditional authentic omakase, no fancy as others. The warm design felt like in Japan, the art of simplicity and combination of food ingredients that let me and my friend had a great memorable time at this place. I especilly valued the gift received by the chef, it was a home-made candle, made by the chef with a lovely scent.\nRead more\nWritten May 5, 2025",
