            "review_title": "Review at Kappou Nishiyama",
            "review_text": "L Q\n203 contributions\n0\nTrust me - you will have a memorable meal\nMar 2025 • Couples\nThis Omakase (“trust the chef”) restaurant is a true gem. You sit at an elegant bar facing the multi-lingual chef the entire evening and he describes each exquisite dish to you, doubling the enjoyment of the meal. The dishes were amazing, featuring very high end ingredients and wonderful composition. I won’t ruin the reveal by providing too much detail. The ambiance is peaceful and the service impeccable. This is the most expensive meal we had in HCMC but it was worth every VND. Drinks are included in your set price. We order the smaller of the two set dinner menus and it was plenty of food for us. In addition, it was my husband’s birthday and they surprised us with a birthday cake and a song. The restaurant is in an alley (like all good things in Vietnam) -look for the Pasteur Brewing sign.\nRead more\nWritten March 3, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
