            "review_text": "Hiroshima Thao\nDa Nang, Vietnam3 contributions\n0\nrecommend it for those who love the original taste of the sushi,sashimi, japanese food\nSep 2022 • Business\nKappou Nishiyama is a Japanese Omakase style, it is not difficult for you to find because it is located in district 1 of HCMc.\n\nMy first impression when I arrived was the friendly services and facilities that reminded me of the years I lived in Japan before\n\nAbout the food (meat, fish, seafood) is very good, fresh vegetables, perfect sauce and excellent taste like when I eat in Japan.\n\nThe chef (Mr Nishiyama) is a warm person and good communicator. The staff are friendly and helpful. They serve each customer that comes to their restaurant. They serve drinks, sake, and sometimes, they do it for free!\n\nAbsolutely recommend it for those who love the original taste of sushi, sashimi, Japanese food!\n\nTheir service is Pro!\nRead more\nWritten September 26, 2022",
